  "title": "Sliwkowka Czyli Nalewka ze Sliwek (Polish Purple Plum Liqueur)",
  "description": "Purple plums and sugar are steeped in 190-proof rectified alcohol and vodka for more than 5 months to make this homemade Polish liqueur.",
